  "stageId": "act23side_06",
  "title": "Sight of Autumn",
  "storyCode": "WB-6",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1736f1bcdd76c0b47bc0444e91af4126ced31531f7a3e3143cba9acb972a2a9f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g6_yumengate"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(They work well together... how many of them are there?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Fierce Animal",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_800_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Growls)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, why did they stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why are they looking for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jieyun",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm Waai Fu. Even if they read my name like Huai Hu around here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jieyun",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Waai Fu, Huai Hu... I'll remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jieyun",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm Jieyun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jieyun",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll come back and find you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Strange girl..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Waai Fu",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's catch some bad people first."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man gazes over the map, drawing a course.\nHis gaze moves slowly. He knows how vast a distance every inch on the paper represents.\nThe tea on the table has long grown cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't think you would enjoy our provincial Yumen tea, Grand Tutor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone here drinks the same tea. So can I."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This tea is Yin in nature. It's not ideal while the weather is cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your knowledge is vast, but you don't pay enough attention to your health."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The others would be anxious if you fell ill."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Someone better will take my place, if I fall ill. Each generation is better than the one that came before. There is no single person whom Yan cannot do without."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is important is not one person, one generation, but the legacy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Such has always been the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Legacy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A difficult concept for us to understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've taught countless people who've contributed to Great Yan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The army still uses the martial records left behind by the Record Keepers for training. I myself have received military instruction from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At the end of the day, I, we, our expertise, it was all learned from others."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chongyue dumps the cold tea and pours a new cup of hot tea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Since when have we become strangers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've never forgotten the times when we discussed matters of state over candlelight, and drew swords alongside one another."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But where we stand has changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse my impudence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You didn't come just to talk about old times, did you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I came to say goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, Envoy Lin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wasn't it two days ago that we last saw each other?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More has happened in two days than in the twenty years prior."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now that I think about it, you did what you did that day not to help me, but to stop me from investigating."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I still helped you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I had heard that the L.G.D. sent an acting inspector to oversee matters of public security when the two cities were docked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I could not associate the commotion you caused at the market and the Sword Forge with the young girl who stands before me now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you set your sights on me from the beginning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, only just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wasn't sure that all this was your doing, until you showed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You only suspected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your style is... unique."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've always been like this. Did you want to say 'unscrupulous?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could you really call all that you have done scrupulous?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fair enough. But what specifically did you mean by 'all that?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Working with the Shanhaizhong, faking the bandit attack on the Messenger, then setting up an attack on me, making the fake Catastrophe data 'real.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then you had someone else steal the Grandmaster's sword to muddy the waters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The theft of the sword was unexpected. Otherwise, last night would never have happened..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But it is impressive that you've deduced the switching of the data."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good thing you had enough decency to not actually kill the Messenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have a question myself. Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sure you already know the answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You wanted to cause a Catastrophe and destroy Yumen just because you had a grudge against the Lord Exorcist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zuo Xuanliao and us have been through more than hell and high water together. The word 'grudge' is far too light."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And Zuo Xuanliao has taken us too lightly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are from Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've heard it's a good place. A prosperous one. I never had a chance to visit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've seen how things are at Yumen. Traveling through the desert all year long, risking Catastrophe to deliver important reports, trekking through nothing but sand for days in search of water... you've never experienced that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Someone has to protect the borders, protect the nation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Soldier or civilian, most Yumenites are not local. We left our homes to settle here, without a word of complaint."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zuo Xuanliao should not forget that there are others who had a hand in Yumen becoming Yan's bulwark! Who does he think he is? Driving away those who have bled for Yumen?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You misunderstood the Lord Exorcist."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then why is the Grandmaster leaving Yumen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What I can't understand is why you want to destroy the city that you've protected for so many years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How many Catastrophes do you think Yumen has encountered in its history?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A single Catastrophe won't destroy Yumen. It will only unite its people!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Madman."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two young people cower in a corner of a warehouse, looking rather haggard."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Qis..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where are the others? What about the soldiers and the Messenger?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Old Meng from the Sword Forge let them go just now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank goodness they're alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "M-Miss Du..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry, we didn't get the job done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The guys from the Sword Forge knocked us out before we even knew what was going on. We found ourselves in the warehouse by the time we came to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why did they do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a long story."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come on, stop with the long face!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Bodyguard",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B-But it's Xingyu Logistics's first job..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We ran into something this big on our first job! That means we're meant for big things!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Du Yaoye",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now put yourself together and follow me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g7_zuosroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have an idea of where the sword is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You had an idea from the beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a little private interest. I guess I couldn't keep it from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone has private interests."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's fine, as long as it doesn't interfere with duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have an idea whom to entrust the sword to. I just want to see the last trial through."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "With your permission, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The goodbye you mentioned, it's more than just this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The path ahead is unknown. Who knows if we'll meet again? A proper farewell is in order."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yumen is headed for the capital."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It is about to wake."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man turns around and once again casts his eyes towards the map. He sees and thinks about much on it.\nHe suddenly has a question, one that the 'Grand Tutor' would not have asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you have regrets?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Parting is a fact of life. Seeking perfection doesn't mean there won't be regrets."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But sometimes I feel that there just isn't much I can do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yumen started out as a fortress built for that hunt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The hero of Yumen could have humble beginnings, or he could belong to one of the long-lived races, but the one thing he cannot be is the incarnation of a Feranmut."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is a secret that the Sui Regulator must protect at all costs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "One cannot expect to be understood and accepted no matter where one goes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man walks slowly to the old man's side, and the two of them gaze silently at the depiction of mountains and rivers."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yumen will approach the capital in six months, barring any unexpected events."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The markings on the map are locations where civilians are expected to be evacuated prior to Yumen's arrival at the capital."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If things get to that point, Yumen must be prepared to sacrifice itself to kill the bestial Sui. This is a price that Yan must pay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Shanhaizhong struck twenty years ago. Lord Exorcist came to me after things calmed down, before the Sui Regulator arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He realized then that the bestial Sui were a great potential threat to Yan. Yumen will someday return to its original battlefield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When it comes to that, Yumen cannot rely on me or the jianghu fighters. Everyone must go. This place that many people have called home will return to dust."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "People on the outside call the Lord Exorcist heartless, but there's so much that he cannot tell anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We had a group of common friends..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those who carry heavy responsibilities cannot be trapped by private sentiment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Twenty years of conflict. There were misunderstandings, and there were grudges, but there must be closure. This is something that I need to do myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is a private request. I dare not ask for your understanding."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yet in some cases, an allowance can be made."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shuo is part of that atrocity, but the people of Yan owe Chongyue a great debt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So what you mean is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Lord Exorcist has tasked you to ensure my safety."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grand Tutor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_301_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What danger is there to me, if you can protect Yumen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man turns and leaves the tent.\nThe old man nods slightly in his direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "35_g8_yumenarena"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Chongyue",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lord Wei..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can be of help in the hunt for the criminals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will see you off."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air feels dead, silent. The only sound is that of gravel as it falls on the roof.\nThe warehouse has no windows. Lin Yühsia listens intently for any sounds outside. Minute after minute passes. Have the Catastrophe clouds drawn closer?\nThe night winds blow stronger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You look impatient, Miss Lin."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you for chatting with this old man. Perhaps it's because you thought I may still have the real data collected by the Catastrophe Messenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why would you give it away for nothing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's too late for Yumen to avoid the Catastrophe now, even if the correct data reached the Imperial Astronomical Bureau."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I would like to make it clear that this plan was entirely my own. The folks who were taken into custody are innocent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good to see you still know what 'innocent' is, after putting an entire city's worth of people in danger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There is act of nature, and there is act of man. They should not be confused."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You must have other reasons for delaying me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. I would not simply waste time on a day like today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I had promised to help an acquaintance leave the city, but I have no choice but to go back on that promise after what happened at the Sword Forge last night. I can only hope to draw more attention and make it easier for her to get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The sword thief? Didn't you say the theft was unexpected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Astute as ever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But this is a rather silly matter. Too silly to talk about."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let those who should leave, leave. Let the debts that should be settled, be settled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You got what you came for, Miss Lin. You should leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There was one thing you didn't catch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not just Zuo Xuanliao I hold a grudge against."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I picked this time and place to settle another debt."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lin Yühsia",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You hide well. You made us work to find you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You turned your back on our partnership."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Weren't you trying to silence me when you went to the Sword Forge last night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Boss",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get the data from the girl. Leave this one to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shanhaizhong Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_794_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe you misunderstood."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old man opens a bag on his belt and takes out an unremarkable black iron hammer.\nHe glares at the Shanhaizhong and speaks through clenched teeth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meng Tieyi",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hide? I've been waiting for a chance to finish all of you off!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "aliases": [
        "Wei Yenwu"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
